osts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-12T07:50:59-08:00","id":1157931,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Laughing Stranger</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1157561-how-could-the-yeren-unwittingly-help-gaia?p=1157605#post1157605\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Yeren desire power to the point of accumulating it all for themselves. After decades of clandestine deals, shadow warfare and judicious betrayal, a cabal of elder Yeren bankrupt or seize all of Pentex's primary constituent corporations, leaving the conglomerate a shell of its former self... but allowing the Yeren to become incredibly wealthy. Corrupt and glutted with success, the highest ranking Yeren bask in glory as the Wyrm's chosen inheritors of the failing earth and gather for a debauched victory celebration... only to be slaughtered by Gaian warrior packs. The Black Spiral Dancers, the nominal allies and defenders of the Yeren, are nowhere to be found... and it is a mystery as to how the Garou Nation learned of the precise time and location of the Yeren gathering.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Sure their isnt a Black spiral Dancer somewhere smirking shaking his head saying &quot;Good riddance&quot;<br /> <br /> Oh, if I could ask a question on another mockery breed real quick? <br /> <br /> War Wolves? I have 2 questions actually, in a kinfolk game Im running.<br /> <br /> 1. Ideas on how to give players a sporting chance and a heads up they need to carry guns.<br /> <br /> 2: Do Warwolves regenerate lethal, or do they need to be in peaceful